### Test Staff Remaining Payment

### 1. Nhân viên thanh toán phần còn lại cho guest
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings/{{propertyId}}/{{bookingId}}/payment/remaining/staff
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "paymentMethod": "vnpay",
  "returnUrl": "https://example.com/payment/return",
  "cancelUrl": "https://example.com/payment/cancel"
}

### 2. Admin thanh toán phần còn lại cho guest
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings/{{propertyId}}/{{bookingId}}/payment/remaining/staff
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "paymentMethod": "momo",
  "returnUrl": "https://example.com/payment/return",
  "cancelUrl": "https://example.com/payment/cancel"
}

### 3. Test validation - Không có quyền (guest)
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings/{{propertyId}}/{{bookingId}}/payment/remaining/staff
Authorization: Bearer {{guestToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "paymentMethod": "vnpay",
  "returnUrl": "https://example.com/payment/return"
}

### 4. Test validation - Staff không được assign cho property
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings/{{otherPropertyId}}/{{bookingId}}/payment/remaining/staff
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "paymentMethod": "vnpay",
  "returnUrl": "https://example.com/payment/return"
}

### 5. Test validation - Booking không tồn tại
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings/{{propertyId}}/507f1f77bcf86cd799439011/payment/remaining/staff
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "paymentMethod": "vnpay",
  "returnUrl": "https://example.com/payment/return"
}

### 6. Test validation - Không còn tiền cần thanh toán
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings/{{propertyId}}/{{paidBookingId}}/payment/remaining/staff
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "paymentMethod": "vnpay",
  "returnUrl": "https://example.com/payment/return"
}

### 7. Test validation - Booking không ở trạng thái cho phép thanh toán
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings/{{propertyId}}/{{cancelledBookingId}}/payment/remaining/staff
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "paymentMethod": "vnpay",
  "returnUrl": "https://example.com/payment/return"
}

### 8. Lấy thông tin booking để kiểm tra
GET {{baseUrl}}/bookings/{{propertyId}}/{{bookingId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Variables cho test
# @baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
# @authToken = your_staff_jwt_token_here
# @adminToken = your_admin_jwt_token_here
# @staffToken = your_staff_jwt_token_here
# @guestToken = your_guest_jwt_token_here
# @propertyId = your_property_id_here
# @otherPropertyId = another_property_id_here
# @bookingId = your_booking_id_here
# @paidBookingId = fully_paid_booking_id_here
# @cancelledBookingId = cancelled_booking_id_here 